\whitespace trim
<!-- Heading of a type hub whose body is a list (cascade entry config/title-hub; Quest, Player and
     Event show their own numbers or none): the translated display name, behind it the number of
     the entries the active view sees (trpg.hub.entries) as a pill - styles/hubs. Same markup as
     templates/title-translated plus the pill. -->
<h2 class="tc-title">
<$text text={{{ [<currentTiddler>trpgtitle[]] }}}/>
<span class="trpg-hub-count"><$text text={{{ [trpg.hub.entries<currentTiddler>count[]] }}}/></span>
</h2>
